I finally won a game of NH3.0 (patch level 5) with Bub the Priest.  He
had adequate armor (AC -47), pretty good weapons (blessed +9 Mjollnir,
blessed +7 Stormbringer), 30th experience level, 370 hit points, and
enough wands of death to destroy the Wizard whenever he developed the
courage to die.

Anyway, my final score was 138,000,000 and change.  HOWEVER, the score
file only showed 1,380,000.  I ended up depressed until my kind dungeon
master modified the file to accurately reflect the score.  The score file
should provide enough capacity in the score field to provide for perfectly
attainable scores above 9,999,999.
